    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kisirwor Yosua ŋituŋa alo Sekem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Yosua tocunak ŋikabilae a Ŋisirael daadaŋ Sekem. Tonyaraiya iŋes ŋikasikou, ŋikarikok, ŋikatubok ŋakiro ka ŋikapolok, totukokinos ŋul daadaŋ kiŋaren Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Yosua lotuŋa daadaŋ, “Ebala Ekapolon ŋolo erae Akuj a Ŋisirael ebe, ‘Koloŋ sek apotu atapapaa kus kiboiyoto ayaaye aŋolol Eupurate, epei atapapaa kus a ŋul iŋes Tera papa keŋ ka Aburaam ka Naor. Apaki ŋin, elipete ikes neni a ŋakujo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ayoŋ oyau papaa kus Aburaam alokekwaye aŋolol Eupurate, abu etenite iŋes anakwap a Kanaan a daadaŋ ka oinak iŋes ŋiletok ŋulu alalak, abu oinak iŋes ikoku Isaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abu oinak Isaka ŋisapa lu: Yakob ka Esau, oinak Esau akwap ŋina a ŋikamukumukui ŋina eyai emoru Seir, nai abu Yakob ka ŋidwe keŋ totiyaaros Ijipit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ayoŋ eyakiya Moses ka Aron neni atapapaa kus nakwap a Ijipit ka abu esican ŋituŋa a Ijipit nooi a ŋakisicaneta a ŋuna abu esicania ikes, ido okoriku iyes anakwap a Ijipit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ayauni ayoŋ atapapaa kus alo Ijipit, ipotu iyes todolut Nanam ŋina Areŋan, ido apotu Ŋijipitian ikiwuapakis a ŋagaari ka a ŋaŋolei, todolut tari Nanam ŋina Areŋan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu atapapaa kus kikaloikis Ekapolon akiŋarakin ikes, tosodi abu Ekapolon kiwuak akiryonut kidiŋ ŋisigarya a Ijipit ka iyes, tomunya Ŋijipitian a ŋakipi a ŋuna ka anam. Iyenete iyes ŋilopeyek ŋuna abu ayoŋ etiya lotuŋa a Ijipit. Ekaku, ipotu iyes kiboiyoto apaki ŋina aoyan analoŋisat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ayoŋ okoyau iyes nakwap a Ŋiamori a ŋulu eboiyete alo Kide aŋolol Yorodan. Apotu ikes ikitijikis iyes, nai abu ayoŋ epotokikes nakan kus. Abu ayoŋ omunya ikes alokiŋaren kus, ido ipotu iyes kikamasi akwap kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋina acamitor Balak lokoku a Sipor ŋolo arae erwosit a Moab akitijiore Ŋisirael, abu iŋes kiyakiya ŋituŋa neni a Balaam a lokoku a Beor abunore agatakin ikes ŋuna aronok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu ayoŋ nyapupoki ŋakiro a Balaam, aŋun, abu iŋes toboŋonok akiterereŋ, ido abu ayoŋ okolaku iyes aneni keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipotu nai iyes todoka aŋolol Yorodan totubunos Yeriko, neni aponiata ŋituŋa a Yeriko ikitijioto iyes lopite ŋolo aponiata ŋikabilae lu ikitijioto iyes: Ŋiamori, Ŋiperisi, Ŋikanaani, Ŋiitaiti, Ŋigerigasi, Ŋiipi ka Ŋiyebusi; nai abu ayoŋ epotok ikes nakan kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ayoŋ ewuak ekabule lorwosi ŋuluarei ŋulu a Ŋiamori eriŋa iyes nyedolo neni kec, ido apotu ikes tosuros, meere aŋuna a ŋileŋia kus, kori aŋuna a ŋikaleŋeleŋe kus asurotor ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu ayoŋ okoinak iyes akwap ŋina pa ibukoritotori ŋakinyinyir ka ŋitaunio ŋulu pa arae iyes idukokinete, ido iboiyete iyes alotooma kec ka inyamete ŋaraito ke epiini ka icuyete akimyet a ŋikito a ŋulu enyaritae Olipa, ŋikito ŋulu pa arae iyes idupakinete.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tokona nai, itemokino iyes tokerito Ekapolon ka kitiyanakis iŋes anakikinyoma kus a daadaŋ. Toŋero akitiyanakin ŋakujo ŋuna ewuapito atapapaa kus alokekwaye aŋolol Eupurate ka anakwap a Ijipit, nai kitiyanakisi Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani pa kejok aneni kus akitiyanakin Ekapolon, toseutu nai iyes ŋilopeyek nakoloŋit na ŋini itiyanakinete; kerae ŋakujo ŋuna etiyanakinete atapapaa kus Alokekwaye Aŋolol Eupurate, kori ŋakujo a Ŋiamori a ŋulu iboiyete iyes nakwap kec. Ani ayoŋ ka ekal kaŋ, ikitiyanakini Ekapolon.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋokis nai ŋituŋa temasi, “Nyikiryama ca isua ka akiŋer Ekapolon, kitiyanakinae ŋakujo ŋace! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anerae erae Ekapolon ŋolo erae Akuj kosi iŋes abu ikiyau isua ka atapapaa kosi anakwap a Ijipit, aneni araakare isua ŋipi, abu kitiya ŋaumonokineta ŋuna apolok kiteetei isua. Abu iŋes ikiten isua alorotin a daadaŋ ka anakwapin a daadaŋ a ŋuna aponi isua tolomarae analosit kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon Akuj tobwaŋ alokiŋaren kosi ŋakwapin daadaŋ kaapei ka Ŋiamori ŋulu alomito nakwap na. Aŋun, ikicamit isua daŋ akitiyanakin Ekapolon, anerae erae iŋes Akuj kosi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu Yosua tolimok ŋituŋa tema, “Nyipedorete iyes akitiyanakin Ekapolon. Erae iŋes Akuj ŋina Asegan; erae iŋes Akuj ŋina alilyan. Nyisyoni iŋes ŋasecisya aŋuna ka aŋerit kus iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ca kiŋero iyes Ekapolon, kitiyanakis ŋakujo ŋunagelae, ikimani iŋes iyes, ido ikisican, itomunya iyes, torae bo sek ajok Ekapolon aneni kus.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu ŋituŋa temasi neni a Yosua, “Mam! Ikitiyanakini isua Ekapolon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok nai Yosua ikes tema, “Iyes pei icamut aruwor ŋisuudae kus a ŋilopeyek aŋuna iseuniata akitiyanakin Ekapolon.” Temasi ŋituŋa, “Ee, ikirae isua ŋisuudae.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Yosua ikes tema, “Tokona nai toŋero ŋakujo ŋunagelae ŋuna iyakatar iyes, kiikisi atemar iwuapete iyes Ekapolon bon ŋolo erae Akuj a Ŋisirael.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa tolimokis Yosua temasi, “Ekapolon bon ŋolo erae Akuj kosi, iŋes ecamitae isua akitiyanakin ka akiwuap ŋakiro keŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋina acunakinitor Yosua Ŋisirael Sekem, abu iŋes towoik ikes anacamunet ke Ekapolon, ayakasi nacamunet ŋin Ŋikisila ka ŋakiro ŋuna amaikina Ŋisirael kiwuapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigir Yosua ŋakiro ŋun lokitaabo ŋolo a Ŋikisila a ŋulu ka Akuj, tosodi tolemu amoru ŋina apolon, tosipok diyete ekuyon ŋolo apolon ŋolo ayai nakibois ŋina Asegan ŋina ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok nai Yosua ŋituŋa daadaŋ tema, “Amoru na iŋes ikisuudae iwon aŋuna adaunia akiirar ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna erwor Ekapolon neni yok. Iŋes ebuni akisuuda iyes erae pa kiwuap iyes acamit a Akuj kus.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitolot nai Yosua ŋituŋa, toloto ŋulutuŋa nakwap kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atwanare a Yosua ka ŋina ka Eleasar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
