          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋisirael kitiyanakis Ekapolon ŋirwa daadaŋ ŋulu ayarya Yosua ka ŋulu a ŋikasikou a ŋulu apotu kidoŋo ketwana Yosua, ŋikasikou ŋulu ayenete ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna ajokak ŋuna etiyat Ekapolon neni a Ŋisirael.",
          "type": "text",
