              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi tonukae ŋakoyo a Yosepu ŋuna sek keyaunete Ŋisirael anakwap a Ijipit nakwap ŋina kegyeli Yakob a ŋisilipae a amiat alodwe ka Amor a papa keŋ a Sekem. Abu akwap ŋina toruwor ŋina a ŋituŋa a Yosepu.",
          "type": "text",
